        "SourceString": "Morvathis, represents the primordial void and the deepest, most unfathomable aspects of existence. As a fundamental force of creation and destruction, Morvathis embodies the concept of endless potential and the unknown. This deity is associated with the depths of the earth and the mysteries of death, but also with the emergence of new life and order from seeming nothingness. Morvathis is often depicted as an ever-changing, formless entity, reflecting the unpredictable nature of the cosmos.",
